# Diamond story 34-hearthome-gym-fantina-relic-badge: standalone start (--lab, or no end save from 33-celestic-to-hearthome-gym).
# Standard header + lab party + the cumulative state after 33-celestic-to-hearthome-gym, then the milestone's start. Names resolve
# through tests/gameplay/labc.py --game diamond; flag/var lines cite the D/P script that sets them.
name GQ
gender PLAYER_GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 31415
money 20000
# Standard lab party (Platinum exemplar): Surf in slot 0 and slots 1-3 cleared, so an empty Surf falls back to
# Struggle instead of stalling A-only battles. Staraptor carries the field moves (Rock Smash, Cut) and fights only
# in true doubles.
# Opponent: TRAINER_LEADER_FANTINA_FANTINA trdata.json #318 DRIFBLIM 32, GENGAR 34, MISMAGIUS 36 @SITRUS_BERRY, 2x
# HYPER_POTION: Surf is neutral on Ghost and a Normal/Fighting lead would be immune, so keep the Surf lead. Wrong-door
# trainers (#357 #325 #266 #330 #340 #343 #280 #284, lv26-30 ghosts) are only met off the correct path.
party SPECIES_EMPOLEON 60 ITEM_NONE
party-move 0 0 MOVE_SURF
party-move 0 1 MOVE_NONE
party-move 0 2 MOVE_NONE
party-move 0 3 MOVE_NONE
party SPECIES_STARAPTOR 50 ITEM_NONE
party-move 1 0 MOVE_AERIAL_ACE
party-move 1 1 MOVE_ROCK_SMASH
party-move 1 2 MOVE_CUT
# @@PRIOR@@
# -- start --
warp MAP_HEARTHOME_GYM_FIRST_QUESTION_ROOM 3  # (9,22), zone_event 0087 warp 3; 33's end
